...@../../../dev/d2/themes/sequence
# W02: selected success schedule; failure and evidence axes are separate views.
shape: sequence_diagram
adapter: Protocol adapter
coord: Rust coordinator
scheme: Scheme owner
issuer: Grant authority
ledger: Admission ledger
adapter -> coord: Freeze the authenticated operation
coord -> ledger: S1: reserve holds and prepare the flow
ledger -> coord: Confirm durable Prepared at cut V
coord -> scheme: S2: authorize the exact admitted request
scheme -> issuer: Bind evaluation to the trusted source
issuer -> issuer: Require complete matching witnesses\nReject execution errors
issuer -> scheme: Return the signed receipt and grant
scheme -> coord: Bind the grant to its local lifecycle
coord -> scheme: S3: reserve the local grant once
scheme -> coord: Confirm a local reservation\nPerform no external effect
coord -> ledger: Persist the exact ConsumePending command
ledger -> coord: Confirm the durable pending record
coord -> scheme: Deliver the reservation once
scheme -> scheme: Validate the qualified finite source lease
scheme -> coord: Run the synchronous delivery callback\nUse a separate bounded coordinator task
coord -> issuer: Consume the original grant\nBind its exact subject
issuer -> coord: Confirm authenticated consumption
coord.caveat: "Positive consumption is known; sending is not yet authorized. Continue at W10.\nThe Scheme owner remains serialized and uses a qualified finite lease.\nDo not call back into the blocked Scheme owner."
# Shared role accents; brand marks are confined to architecture headers.
adapter.class: cloud
coord.class: runtime
scheme.class: semantic
issuer.class: policy
ledger.class: ledger
coord.caveat.class: note

